	\L_01044:
	\L_00f80:
	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　Helman'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'  Path - Central Square'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'It was a city inhabited by'
	R
	'many lower class citizens.'
	R
	'The people of this town all'
	R
	'lived poor, starved lives.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	!VAR0516 : 462!
	\L_00f9c:
	\L_00f48:
	ZH 1:
	'Up we go...'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f80:
	ZH 1:
	'The man in charge of Helman’s'
	R
	'Crusader Army, council member'
	R
	'Olhound, was helped onto a low'
	R
	'stand by a subordinate.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f48:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah～～...'
	R
	'Fine weather today...'
	R
	'Fine weather today.'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Mmmm.'
	R
	'My voice is so beautiful it'
	R
	'entrances even myself.'
	R
	'Don’t you think so, Granny?'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Granny）'
	R
	'Nyuuuu.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f80:
	ZH 1:
	'Olhound spoke to the'
	R
	'crossbreed of a catball and a'
	R
	'seacat that was in the palm of'
	R
	'his hand.'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'This being had the memories of'
	R
	'Olhound’s wife who had been'
	R
	'separated from him by her'
	R
	'death 30 years ago.'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'But Granny didn’t respond to'
	R
	'Olhound’s statement.'
	R
	'All she could do was mew.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f48:
	ZH 1:
	'I see, I see.'
	R
	'So you agree?'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f80:
	ZH 1:
	'But it was unclear whether'
	R
	'Olhound realized that.'
	R
	'The one-sided conversation'
	R
	'just continued with Granny.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f48:
	ZH 1:
	'About time to get started...'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Aah... Ahem!'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Listen, everyone!!'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f80:
	ZH 1:
	'Olhound spread his arms and'
	R
	'yelled.'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'\"Did something happen?\"'
	R
	'People filtered into the town'
	R
	'square wondering that.'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Due to their poverty, the'
	R
	'people had no ambition.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f48:
	ZH 1:
	'Helman is in the middle of a'
	R
	'crusade!'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... This is a true, just'
	R
	'crusade!'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Do you enjoy starving?'
	R
	'Do you enjoy being poor?'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Of course not.'
	R
	'Anyone would get fed up with'
	R
	'that.'
	R
	'Am I right?'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	!VAR0516 : 496!
	\L_0100c:
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Y-Yes...'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f80:
	ZH 1:
	'Olhound spoke to the closest'
	R
	'young person.'
	R
	'They nodded hastily.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f48:
	ZH 1:
	'That being the case!'
	R
	'I want any courageous people'
	R
	'to assist my Crusader Army!'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'We’re in that church, waiting'
	R
	'for anyone interested!!'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Courageous ones!'
	R
	'Ones who can give their lives'
	R
	'for Empress Sheila!!'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'If you win the fight, you may'
	R
	'receive a reward from Empress'
	R
	'Sheila!'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Ones who wish to say goodbye'
	R
	'to their lives of poverty!!'
	R
	'I’m waiting!'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00faa:
	\L_0101a:
	\L_00f80:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'.........'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'......'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'...'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'After Olhound left with his'
	R
	'subordinates...'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'The town square was filled'
	R
	'with an odd atmosphere of'
	R
	'enthusiasm, and everyone was'
	R
	'talking to each other.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	PF1 VAR0056:
	PF0 VAR0056:
	!VAR0516 : 462!
	\L_00f9c:
	\L_00f80:
	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'Biggest Church in Town'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　Chapel'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f64:
	ZH 1:
	'Hyahyahya...'
	R
	'We’ve gathered quite a few.'
	R
	'My speeches are still strong.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f80:
	ZH 1:
	'Olhound was looking at the'
	R
	'dozens of young people'
	R
	'gathered in the church and'
	R
	'laughing.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f48:
	ZH 1:
	'You’ve done well to come,'
	R
	'everyone.'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Have you all received'
	R
	'education as warriors?'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f80:
	ZH 1:
	'The young people lowered their'
	R
	'heads and avoided eye contact'
	R
	'with Olhound in response to'
	R
	'his question.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f48:
	ZH 1:
	'Don’t worry.'
	R
	'I’m not criticizing you.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f80:
	ZH 1:
	'Olhound pulled a large pill'
	R
	'case out of his pocket.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f48:
	ZH 1:
	'If you take one of these, you'
	R
	'will become a powerful warrior'
	R
	'in an instant.'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'You’ll be able to take down'
	R
	'any man or monster with a'
	R
	'single strike.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f80:
	ZH 1:
	'Olhound’s voice released'
	R
	'murmurs of hope from everyone.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f48:
	ZH 1:
	'Now, take one and swallow it.'
	R
	'If you want to escape from'
	R
	'poverty, that is.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f80:
	ZH 1:
	'The young people lined up in'
	R
	'front of Olhound, taking one'
	R
	'pill from the old man’s hand'
	R
	'after another.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f64:
	ZH 1:
	'Hyahyahyahya...'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	!VAR0516 : 496!
	\L_0100c:
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Hm...?'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Uh... Ah?'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyaaaaaaah!!'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Gwah... Gwaaah!!'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f80:
	ZH 1:
	'All the people that took the'
	R
	'medicine started feeling pain'
	R
	'in unison.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f48:
	ZH 1:
	'Hyahyahyahya!!'
	R
	'Got you, fools!!'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_0101a:
	\L_00f80:
	ZH 1:
	'Gaaaaaah!!!'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Oooooooooh...'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Kshaaaaaaah!!!'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'The youths’ bodies were all'
	R
	'transforming. Their body hair'
	R
	'thickened and grew, and their'
	R
	'muscles bulged freakishly.'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Then one of them got large'
	R
	'fangs, another got sharp'
	R
	'claws...'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'All of them had become'
	R
	'unrecognizable, inhuman'
	R
	'monsters.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f48:
	ZH 1:
	'That medicine you all took'
	R
	'does make you stronger, but it'
	R
	'also takes away your humanity!'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'You lost your intelligence,'
	R
	'but now you’ll listen to my'
	R
	'orders.'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Hyahyahyahyahya!'
	R
	'Aren’t I great, Granny?'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Granny）'
	R
	'Nyuuuuuu.'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Hyahyahyahyahya!'
	R
	'Now, let’s sortie at once!!'
	R
	'You may be strong, but you’ll'
	R
	'only live for one day!'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Come, we’ll annihilate those'
	R
	'Leazas fools!!'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Let’s goooooo!!!'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f80:
	ZH 1:
	'Gwah...'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Gaaaaaah...'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Gii...'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'The now monstrous youths'
	R
	'followed Olhound’s orders and'
	R
	'left the church together.'
	\L_0106d:
