	\L_00f48:
	ZH 1:
	'Hyahyahya...'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Hyahyahyahyahya!!'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f80:
	ZH 1:
	'As usual, Olhound gave some'
	R
	'youths his medicine to produce'
	R
	'ultimate warriors who would'
	R
	'only live a day.'
	\L_0106d:
	{VAR0130 = 1:
		ZH 1:
		'It was done so covertly that'
		R
		'the territory being captured'
		R
		'by the Leazas Army didn’t'
		R
		'change anything.'
		\L_0106d:
	}
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f48:
	ZH 1:
	'Now go!'
	R
	'Give Leazas a bloodbath!'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Use those bodies my genius'
	R
	'self imparted on you!!'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Hyahyahyahya!!'
	R
	'Kill, kill, kill!'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Kill, kill them all, show'
	R
	'everyone the greatness of my'
	R
	'medicine!!'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f80:
	ZH 1:
	'Olhound cackled to the heavens'
	R
	'while the monsters headed to'
	R
	'battle like a wave parting'
	R
	'around him.'
