	\L_0100c:
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'King Rance.'
	R
	'A strange old man was found'
	R
	'hiding in a church.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_0101a:
	!VAR0516 : 462!
	\L_0100c:
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Owowowowow... How could you do'
	R
	'this to a feeble old man?!'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00ff0:
	ZH 1:
	'Olhound was captured by'
	R
	'Rance’s subordinates.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f48:
	ZH 1:
	'...He certainly is strange.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'What are you talking about?'
	R
	'I’m just a feeble old man.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f48:
	ZH 1:
	'Nah.'
	R
	'My intuition tells me you’re'
	R
	'dangerous.'
	R
	'Definitely strange.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'What basis do you have for'
	R
	'that?'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f48:
	ZH 1:
	'None.'
	R
	'What I do have...'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'Is myself, who’s right about'
	R
	'everything!'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'What nonsense!'
	R
	'I’m the one who’s right!!'
	R
	'Everything I make is perfect!!'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f48:
	ZH 1:
	'Everything you make??'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s right.'
	R
	'Such as... Oh yes.'
	R
	'An army of monsters to toy'
	R
	'with the Leazas Army, and...'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f48:
	ZH 1:
	'What?'
	R
	'You made them?'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Hyahyahyahya.'
	R
	'That’s right.'
	R
	'Scared now?'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f48:
	ZH 1:
	'Not really scared...'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m thinking about how much'
	R
	'shit we had to deal with'
	R
	'thanks to them.'
	R
	'Die!!'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f80:
	ZH 1:
	'　　＜slashhhh）'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyaaaaaaaaah!!!'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_0101a:
	\L_00f80:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance gave Olhound a'
	R
	'satisfying slash.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00f48:
	ZH 1:
	'Hmph.'
	R
	'Killed a boring guy.'
	R
	'Let’s go.'
	\L_0106d:
	\L_01060:
	\L_00faa:
	\L_00f80:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance left Olhound there and'
	R
	'departed.'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'.........'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'......'
	\L_0106d:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'...'
